---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import { mcpUrl } from '../lib/catalogue';
import { resources, resourceUri, mcpTools } from '../lib/mcp-surface';
import { mcpService } from '../config/mcp';
import { discovery } from '../config/discovery';
import { a2a } from '../config/a2a';
const title = 'Model Context Protocol';
const description = mcpService.description;
const example = JSON.stringify({ mcpServers: { 'danilo-profile': { type: 'http', url: mcpUrl } } }, null, 2);
---
<Site {title} {description}>
  <PageHeading {title} {description} />
  <div class="split">
    <div class="stack">
      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Connect a client</h2>
        <p>Add <code>{mcpUrl}</code> as a remote Streamable HTTP server. The endpoint is public and read-only.</p>
        <pre class="code-block"><code>{example}</code></pre>
        <p>Client configuration varies. Choose the HTTP transport, then try <code>get_profile</code> or call <code>search_content</code> with <code>{'{"query":"SmartVehicle","limit":5}'}</code>.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Tools</h2>
        <dl class="definition">
          {Object.entries(mcpTools).map(([name, { description }]) => <><dt><code>{name}</code></dt><dd>{description}</dd></>)}
        </dl>
      </section>
    </div>
    <aside class="stack" aria-label="Resources and access">
      <section class="panel">
        <h2>JSON resources</h2>
        <ul class="plain-list">{resources.map(resource => <li><code>{resourceUri(resource.id)}</code></li>)}</ul>
      </section>
      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Access and limits</h2>
        <p>The server supports stateless Streamable HTTP with current and compatible 2025 clients. Requests are capped at 16 KiB. Search and lists return up to 30 items. Send only public queries.</p>
        <p><a href="/mcp-data.json">Download the public JSON catalogue</a></p>
        <p><a href="/llms.txt">Browse text and machine-readable formats</a></p>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li><a href={mcpService.cardPath}>MCP Server Card</a></li>
          <li><a href={discovery.ard.path}>ARD manifest</a></li>
          <li><a href={discovery.apiCatalog.path}>API catalog</a></li>
          <li><a href={discovery.skills.path}>Agent Skills index</a></li>
          <li><a href={a2a.cardPath}>A2A Agent Card</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p>The A2A catalogue assistant answers standalone text requests such as <code>projects: SmartVehicle</code>. Send <code>POST {a2a.sendPath}</code> with <code>A2A-Version: {a2a.protocolVersion}</code>.</p>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Site>
